#: ../../technical/articles/109-workflow-execution-and-local-filing-orchestration.md:14
msgid "Workflow execution"
msgstr "Ejecución de flujos de trabajo"

#: ../../technical/articles/109-workflow-execution-and-local-filing-orchestration.md:16
msgid ""
"`WorkflowEngine` coordinates a staged local filing pipeline: load the "
"typed taxpayer profile, compute/select an obligation, optionally inspect "
"notifications and prior filings, load inputs and build a registry-backed "
"draft, check identity/schema alignment and findings, then run local "
"preflight. The engine accepts narrow Protocol collaborators for "
"deadlines, data inputs, drafts, auth provider descriptions, and live "
"reads. A successful result records a draft and terminal stages, while "
"`submission_id` remains `None`: this chunk orchestrates validation and "
"local filing work, it does not itself transmit a declaration to AEAT. "
"engine.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) protocols.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/protocols.py`) protocols.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/protocols.py`) protocols.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/protocols.py`)"
msgstr ""
"`WorkflowEngine` coordina un proceso local de presentación por etapas: "
"cargar el perfil tipado del contribuyente, calcular o seleccionar una "
"obligación, inspeccionar opcionalmente notificaciones y presentaciones "
"anteriores, cargar entradas y construir un borrador respaldado por el "
"registro, comprobar alineación de identidad y esquema y hallazgos y "
"ejecutar comprobaciones previas locales. El motor acepta colaboradores "
"Protocol limitados para plazos, entradas de datos, borradores, "
"descripciones de proveedores de autenticación y lecturas en vivo. Un "
"resultado satisfactorio registra un borrador y etapas finales, mientras "
"que `submission_id` permanece `None`: este bloque orquesta validación y "
"trabajo local de presentación, no transmite por sí mismo una declaración "
"a la AEAT. engine.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) "
"engine.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) protocols.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/protocols.py`) protocols.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/protocols.py`) protocols.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/protocols.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/109-workflow-execution-and-local-filing-orchestration.md:18
msgid ""
"Deadline selection shares the domain schedule producer used by state "
"projections. `FILE` requires a matching open obligation for the ordinary "
"next-work path; an explicitly targeted late period can continue as a "
"locally marked extemporaneous workflow, while an absent or closed "
"untargeted obligation aborts. `VERIFY` treats the filing window as "
"informational and can build against a synthetic `NOT_APPLICABLE` "
"obligation when no calendar row matches its explicit target. More than "
"one exact schedule match is an integrity failure rather than an "
"application-level choice. engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) _deadline_stage.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/_deadline_stage.py`) "
"_deadline_stage.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/_deadline_stage.py`)"
msgstr ""
"La selección de plazos comparte el productor de calendarios del dominio "
"utilizado por las proyecciones de estado. `FILE` exige una obligación "
"abierta coincidente para la ruta ordinaria del siguiente trabajo; un "
"período tardío seleccionado explícitamente puede continuar como flujo "
"marcado localmente extemporáneo, mientras que una obligación ausente o "
"cerrada sin destino explícito aborta. `VERIFY` trata el plazo de "
"presentación como informativo y puede construir frente a una obligación "
"sintética `NOT_APPLICABLE` cuando ninguna fila del calendario coincide "
"con su destino explícito. Más de una coincidencia exacta del calendario "
"es un fallo de integridad, no una elección del nivel de aplicación. "
"engine.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) "
"_deadline_stage.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/_deadline_stage.py`) "
"_deadline_stage.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/_deadline_stage.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/109-workflow-execution-and-local-filing-orchestration.md:20
msgid ""
"When wired, the inbox stage blocks on formal `notificacion` rows not "
"marked read; absent session/source is represented as a skip. The prior-"
"expediente probe is likewise conditional on the session and source and "
"blocks a matching already-filed year. Draft construction uses bucket-"
"scoped input providers, then checks draft profile tax ID, modelo, period,"
" and current registry schema version. It rejects non-ready states and "
"ERROR findings before submission preflight. These sources may perform "
"AEAT-side reads when a production host supplies them, even though this "
"engine has no submission stage. engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) protocols.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/protocols.py`) protocols.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/protocols.py`)"
msgstr ""
"Cuando está conectada, la etapa de bandeja de entrada bloquea ante filas "
"formales `notificacion` no marcadas como leídas; la ausencia de sesión u "
"origen se representa como omisión. El sondeo de expedientes previos "
"también depende de sesión y origen y bloquea un año coincidente ya "
"presentado. La construcción de borradores utiliza proveedores de entradas"
" delimitados por depósito y después comprueba identificador fiscal del "
"perfil del borrador, modelo, período y versión actual del esquema del "
"registro. Rechaza estados no preparados y hallazgos ERROR antes de las "
"comprobaciones previas al envío. Estos orígenes pueden realizar lecturas "
"en la AEAT cuando un anfitrión de producción los proporciona, aunque este"
" motor no tiene etapa de envío. engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) protocols.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/protocols.py`) protocols.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/protocols.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/109-workflow-execution-and-local-filing-orchestration.md:22
msgid ""
"Preflight records certificate provider state and expiry severity when a "
"bundle is present, and can abort on unavailable, expired, or critically "
"near-expiry credentials. Its local submission-engine call skips deadline "
"and auth-readiness flags for both VERIFY and FILE because these are local"
" workflows. There is a scope question worth verifying: "
"`_stage_running_preflight` still calls `_resolve_certificate_preflight` "
"before that skip, so a present but invalid certificate bundle can block "
"VERIFY/FILE; a missing bundle is merely recorded as not wired. Also, "
"inbox and already-filed reads can still be contacted when their optional "
"sources are supplied. Confirm which local workflow modes are intended to "
"remain independent of configured credentials and external reads. "
"engine.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) protocols.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/protocols.py`)"
msgstr ""
"La comprobación previa registra estado del proveedor de certificados y "
"gravedad de caducidad cuando hay un conjunto presente y puede abortar "
"ante credenciales no disponibles, caducadas o críticamente próximas a "
"caducar. Su llamada local al motor de envío omite indicadores de plazo y "
"preparación de autenticación tanto para VERIFY como FILE porque son "
"flujos locales. Hay una cuestión de ámbito que conviene verificar: "
"`_stage_running_preflight` sigue llamando a "
"`_resolve_certificate_preflight` antes de esa omisión, por lo que un "
"conjunto de certificados presente pero no válido puede bloquear "
"VERIFY/FILE; uno ausente simplemente se registra como no conectado. "
"Además, todavía pueden realizarse consultas a bandeja de entrada y "
"presentaciones existentes cuando se proporcionan sus orígenes opcionales."
" Confirma qué modalidades de flujo local deben permanecer independientes "
"de credenciales configuradas y lecturas externas. engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`) protocols.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/protocols.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/109-workflow-execution-and-local-filing-orchestration.md:24
msgid ""
"Each outcome is a typed sequence of stage records with closed abort "
"reasons, timestamps, bounded finding codes, and fact-based precondition "
"verdicts. Site-health and unexpected component failures become structured"
" step failures and include a site-health alert with the same computed run"
" ID; aborts become results rather than exceptions unless a caller "
"explicitly opts into exception behavior. abort.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/abort.py`) engine_recording.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine_recording.py`) "
"engine_recording.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine_recording.py`) engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`)"
msgstr ""
"Cada resultado es una secuencia tipada de registros de etapas con motivos"
" cerrados de aborto, marcas de tiempo, códigos acotados de hallazgos y "
"veredictos de condiciones previas basados en hechos. Los fallos de salud "
"del sitio y los inesperados de componentes se convierten en fallos "
"estructurados de pasos e incluyen una alerta de salud del sitio con el "
"mismo identificador calculado de ejecución; los abortos se convierten en "
"resultados, no excepciones, salvo que quien llama elija explícitamente el"
" comportamiento por excepciones. abort.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/abort.py`) engine_recording.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine_recording.py`) "
"engine_recording.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine_recording.py`) engine.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/109-workflow-execution-and-local-filing-orchestration.md:26
msgid "Profile state, persistence, and recovery"
msgstr "Estado del perfil, persistencia y recuperación"

#: ../../technical/articles/109-workflow-execution-and-local-filing-orchestration.md:28
msgid ""
"Active-profile discovery resolves only committed capsule summaries. It "
"distinguishes no capsule from an unreadable discovery source, refuses "
"ambiguous labels, and does not read manifests or encrypted facts just to "
"list profiles. Active-record resolution then requires an authenticated "
"profile session and the caller's pinned decode context; it returns typed "
"reasons for unavailable record, absent capsule, or misaddressed session. "
"profile_bucket_scan.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/profile_bucket_scan.py`) "
"profile_bucket_scan.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/profile_bucket_scan.py`) "
"active_profile.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/active_profile.py`) "
"active_profile.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/active_profile.py`)"
msgstr ""
"El descubrimiento de perfiles activos solo resuelve resúmenes de cápsulas"
" confirmadas. Distingue ausencia de cápsula de un origen ilegible de "
"descubrimiento, rechaza etiquetas ambiguas y no lee manifiestos ni hechos"
" cifrados solo para enumerar perfiles. La resolución del registro activo "
"exige después una sesión autenticada del perfil y el contexto fijado de "
"decodificación de quien llama; devuelve motivos tipados de registro no "
"disponible, cápsula ausente o sesión dirigida incorrectamente. "
"profile_bucket_scan.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/profile_bucket_scan.py`) "
"profile_bucket_scan.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/profile_bucket_scan.py`) "
"active_profile.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/active_profile.py`) "
"active_profile.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/active_profile.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/109-workflow-execution-and-local-filing-orchestration.md:30
msgid ""
"The health projection carefully separates a committed but locked profile "
"from a dangling pointer, missing/unreadable record, unreadable capsule, "
"and incomplete profile. It is observational and never unlocks or creates "
"credentials. It keeps the resolved label as a private in-process witness,"
" excluding it from serialized health output while allowing the correct "
"login/edit action to be resolved. Confirmed pointer repair takes the "
"pointer transaction and re-assesses eligibility under lock before clear, "
"then re-assesses the result. profile_health.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/profile_health.py`) profile_health.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/profile_health.py`) profile_health.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/profile_health.py`) profile_health.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/profile_health.py`)"
msgstr ""
"La proyección de salud separa cuidadosamente un perfil confirmado pero "
"bloqueado de un puntero colgante, registro ausente o ilegible, cápsula "
"ilegible y perfil incompleto. Es observacional y nunca desbloquea ni crea"
" credenciales. Conserva la etiqueta resuelta como testimonio privado "
"dentro del proceso, excluyéndola de la salida serializada de salud y "
"permitiendo resolver la acción correcta de inicio de sesión o edición. La"
" reparación confirmada del puntero adquiere la transacción del puntero y "
"vuelve a evaluar la elegibilidad bajo bloqueo antes de limpiar, y después"
" reevalúa el resultado. profile_health.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/profile_health.py`) profile_health.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/profile_health.py`) profile_health.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/profile_health.py`) profile_health.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/profile_health.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/109-workflow-execution-and-local-filing-orchestration.md:32
msgid ""
"Workflow state and run history are persisted through an explicitly "
"composed encrypted secure-object port. State supports optimistic revision"
" checks, bounded retries, and transactional sibling writes such as bucket"
" events. Run records are stored in the secure backend rather than the "
"nominal `runs_dir`; loads verify the requested run identity. Reset "
"fingerprints read metadata and readability, append a plaintext-free "
"bucket event before deleting only the workflow-state row, and retain "
"recoverable state if event emission fails. persistence.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/persistence.py`) persistence.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/persistence.py`) persistence.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/persistence.py`) persistence.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/persistence.py`) persistence.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/persistence.py`) persistence.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/persistence.py`) events.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/events.py`) events.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/events.py`)"
msgstr ""
"El estado del flujo y el historial de ejecuciones se persisten mediante "
"un puerto cifrado de objetos seguros compuesto explícitamente. El estado "
"admite comprobaciones optimistas de revisión, reintentos acotados y "
"escrituras transaccionales relacionadas, como eventos del depósito. Los "
"registros de ejecuciones se almacenan en el servicio seguro, no en el "
"`runs_dir` nominal; las cargas verifican la identidad solicitada de "
"ejecución. Las huellas de restablecimiento leen metadatos y legibilidad, "
"anexan un evento del depósito sin texto claro antes de borrar únicamente "
"la fila de estado del flujo y conservan estado recuperable si falla la "
"emisión del evento. persistence.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/persistence.py`) persistence.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/persistence.py`) persistence.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/persistence.py`) persistence.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/persistence.py`) persistence.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/persistence.py`) persistence.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/persistence.py`) events.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/events.py`) events.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/events.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/109-workflow-execution-and-local-filing-orchestration.md:34
msgid ""
"One confirmed documentation mismatch: `reset_workflow_state` says its "
"fingerprint includes a hash of the deleted state, but the typed "
"fingerprint and emitted payload contain only optional schema version, "
"write time, byte length, reason class, and recovered bucket ID. No "
"content hash is computed in these modules. Align the description with "
"actual fields or add the promised digest if downstream audit relies on "
"it. persistence.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/persistence.py`) "
"events.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/events.py`) events.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/events.py`)"
msgstr ""
"Una discrepancia confirmada de documentación: `reset_workflow_state` dice"
" que su huella incluye un hash del estado eliminado, pero la huella "
"tipada y la carga emitida solo contienen versión opcional de esquema, "
"hora de escritura, longitud en bytes, clase de motivo e identificador "
"recuperado del depósito. En estos módulos no se calcula ningún hash de "
"contenido. Alinea la descripción con los campos reales o añade el resumen"
" prometido si la auditoría posterior depende de él. persistence.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/persistence.py`) events.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/events.py`) events.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/events.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/109-workflow-execution-and-local-filing-orchestration.md:36
msgid "Resume and assessment"
msgstr "Reanudación y evaluación"

#: ../../technical/articles/109-workflow-execution-and-local-filing-orchestration.md:38
msgid ""
"Resume first captures an exact persisted run and permits a fresh attempt "
"only when it is terminally aborted, has an obligation and an abort "
"reason, and is not a designed terminal case (`NO_PENDING_OBLIGATION`, "
"`ALREADY_FILED`, `USER_CANCELLED`). Selectors support exact run ID, work-"
"unit ID, calculation-revision ID, or a complete visible "
"modelo/year/period target. Model work-addressing remains the authority "
"for revision and period resolution; multiple natural-key candidates are "
"shown as an ambiguity rather than guessed. resume.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/resume.py`) resume.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/resume.py`) resume.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/resume.py`) resume.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/resume.py`) resume.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/resume.py`)"
msgstr ""
"La reanudación captura primero una ejecución persistida exacta y solo "
"permite un intento nuevo cuando ha terminado abortada, tiene una "
"obligación y un motivo de aborto y no es un caso final diseñado "
"(`NO_PENDING_OBLIGATION`, `ALREADY_FILED`, `USER_CANCELLED`). Los "
"selectores admiten identificador exacto de ejecución, de unidad de "
"trabajo, de revisión de cálculo o un destino visible completo de "
"modelo/año/período. El direccionamiento de trabajo de Modelos sigue "
"siendo la autoridad de resolución de revisión y período; múltiples "
"candidatas de clave natural se muestran como ambigüedad en lugar de "
"adivinarse. resume.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/resume.py`) "
"resume.py (`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/resume.py`) resume.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/resume.py`) resume.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/resume.py`) resume.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/resume.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/109-workflow-execution-and-local-filing-orchestration.md:40
msgid ""
"The registered resume-context operation binds run and calculation readers"
" to the requested profile, verifies the active profile and selected-"
"period scope, captures success/refusal/ambiguity without starting a "
"workflow, and stores the result as a secure operand. Its effect is "
"explicitly `NONE`; release requires a terminal receipt matching "
"definition, profile subject, terminal condition, and refusal references. "
"The frontend receives typed candidate data to choose an exact attempt. "
"resume_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/resume_operation.py`) "
"resume_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/resume_operation.py`) "
"resume_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/resume_operation.py`) "
"resume_operation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/resume_operation.py`)"
msgstr ""
"La operación registrada de contexto de reanudación vincula los lectores "
"de ejecuciones y cálculos al perfil solicitado, verifica el perfil activo"
" y ámbito del período seleccionado, captura éxito, rechazo o ambigüedad "
"sin iniciar un flujo y almacena el resultado como operando seguro. Su "
"efecto es explícitamente `NONE`; la entrega exige un recibo final "
"coincidente en definición, sujeto de perfil, condición final y "
